 "words": 237,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Before the hills, before the sea, before the dawn of days",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Word was there with God, and he was God in all his ways",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All things came into being through him, not one thing apart",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In him was life, and that life was the light of every heart",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the beginning was the Word",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Word was with God, and the Word was God",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The light shines in the darkness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the darkness has not overcome it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There came a man sent from God, and John was his name",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To testify about the light, a witness, so he came",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The true light came into the world that through him came to be",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The world did not know him, and his own would not receive",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But to all who did receive him, who believed in his name",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave the right to become children of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not born of blood or human will, but born of God above",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Held in the Father's mercy and carried in his love",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the beginning was the Word",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Word was with God, and the Word was God",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The light shines in the darkness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the darkness has not overcome it",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Word became flesh and made his dwelling among us",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we have seen his glory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The glory of the Father's only Son",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Full of grace and truth",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
